      "id": "claim_c808bd7739644cfcbefb5f43afddce7e",
      "statement": "Paired notebooks have asymmetric ownership: the Jupytext percent-format `.py` file is the authorial source, while the `.ipynb` is a generated, viewable artifact whose committed outputs must come from a real execution rather than hand editing.",
